<p>Conjures up a beam of darkness, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> darkness damage.</p><p>At level 5, the beam widens to hit foes on each side.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>